    "Story can tag the Moments you record with where you captured them, so your travel memories remember the place. Location is optional, stays on your device, and is never added to the videos you share.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "YoTale 可以为你录制的片段标注拍摄地点，让旅行回忆记住那个地方。定位为可选项，仅保存在你的设备上，不会添加到你分享的视频中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Story can't do %@ yet — it re-cuts, re-times, reorders, sets transitions and changes the soundtrack. Your current version is kept. Try rephrasing with a supported change.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "YoTale 暂时无法做到“%@”——它可以重新剪辑、调整时长、调整顺序、设置转场和更换配乐。你当前的版本已保留，请换一种支持的修改方式试试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Story can't do %@ yet. Apply the supported parts of your request and skip that?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "YoTale 暂时无法做到“%@”。要只应用你请求中支持的部分、跳过它吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
