    "When on, backed-up originals may be automatically freed to save space and re-downloaded on demand. This is OFF by default and separate from Auto Backup. (Automatic optimization stays disabled until testing is complete.)": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，已备份的原片可能会被自动释放以节省空间，并在需要时重新下载。此功能默认关闭，且独立于自动备份。（自动优化在测试完成前保持停用。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, your Moments on this phone — the ones you already have and new ones you add while signed in — are backed up to your YoTale account. Your originals always stay on this iPhone — nothing is deleted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
