    "Your moments changed since this was made.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自生成以来，你的片段有所变化。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Moments on this phone that aren't backed up yet, and new Moments you add while signed in, will be uploaded privately to your YoTale account so they're safe if you lose this phone. Backing up a Moment associates it with this account. Originals stay on this device — nothing is deleted. Wi-Fi only unless you enable cellular. Only you can access your backups.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这部手机上尚未备份的片段，以及你登录期间新增的片段，会私密上传到你的 YoTale 账号，即使手机丢失也不会丢。备份后，片段会与此账号关联。原片会保留在这台设备上，不会删除任何内容。除非开启蜂窝数据，否则仅在 Wi-Fi 下上传。只有你能访问你的备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
